  <!-- EN: When enabled (default), adding the first trait to a base weapon installs an AI persona core, which is refunded when the last trait is removed and the weapon reverts to base. When disabled, the first trait added and the last trait removed are priced like any other change: advanced components (scaled by weapon quality per the table below), which are never refunded. -->
  <PWU_FirstTraitCostsPersonaCoreDesc>활성화하면(기본값) 기본 무기에 첫 특성을 추가할 때 인공자아 핵을 설치하며, 마지막 특성을 제거하여 무기가 기본 형태로 되돌아갈 때 이를 환급합니다. 비활성화하면 첫 특성 추가와 마지막 특성 제거도 다른 변경과 같은 방식으로 값이 매겨집니다. 즉 고급 부품(아래 표에 따라 무기 품질에 비례)을 소모하며, 이는 환급되지 않습니다.</PWU_FirstTraitCostsPersonaCoreDesc>
  <!-- EN: Base component cost per trait change: {0} -->
  <PWU_TraitChangeBaseComponentCost>특성 변경당 기본 부품 비용: {0}</PWU_TraitChangeBaseComponentCost>
  <!-- EN: Advanced components charged for every trait change that doesn't cross the base/persona boundary (both additions and removals cost, neither refunds). Charged regardless of the weapon's quality. Installing a persona core on the first trait, or refunding it on the last, is unaffected by this setting. -->
